      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start but it's a bit too brief. can you make it stronger? i want to emphasize that when schools push these things without parental consent, it's actually undermining the family unit and doing more harm than good. can you add a section about how it's damaging to kids to be exposed to these topics before they're emotionally ready, and how the school is basically overstepping its professional boundaries by trying to take over a role that belongs to parents?",
